{"translation-revision-date":"2026-11-02 16:03:38+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"hu"},"Only the prefixes were added. Find them in Class Manager by searching":["Csak az el\u0151tagok lettek hozz\u00e1adva. Keres\u00e9s seg\u00edts\u00e9g\u00e9vel megtal\u00e1lhatja \u0151ket az Oszt\u00e1lykezel\u0151ben."],"Some new classes used the same names as existing ones. To prevent conflicts, we added the prefix":["N\u00e9h\u00e1ny \u00faj oszt\u00e1ly ugyanazokat a neveket haszn\u00e1lta, mint a megl\u00e9v\u0151k. Az \u00fctk\u00f6z\u00e9sek elker\u00fcl\u00e9se \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben hozz\u00e1adtuk az el\u0151tagot"],"On this page":["Ezen az oldalon"],"Unused":["Nem haszn\u00e1lt"],"Clear Filters":["Sz\u0171r\u0151k t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Convert to global class":["Glob\u00e1lis oszt\u00e1lyra konvert\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Sorry, nothing matched that search.":["Sajn\u00e1ljuk, semmi sem felelt meg a keres\u00e9snek."],"Sorry, nothing matched.":["Sajn\u00e1lom, semmi sem egyezett."],"locations":["helysz\u00ednek"],"location":["hely"],"Locator":["Helymeghat\u00e1roz\u00f3"],"Popup":["Felugr\u00f3 ablak"],"This class isn\u2019t being used yet.":["Ez az oszt\u00e1ly m\u00e9g nincs haszn\u00e1latban."],"Will permanently remove it from your project and may affect the design across all elements using it. Used %1 times across %2 pages. This action cannot be undone.":["V\u00e9glegesen elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a projektb\u0151l, \u00e9s befoly\u00e1solhatja az \u00f6sszes haszn\u00e1l\u00f3 elem terv\u00e9t. %1 alkalommal haszn\u00e1lva %2 oldalon. Ez a m\u0171velet nem vonhat\u00f3 vissza."],"Filters":["Sz\u0171r\u0151k"],"classes":["oszt\u00e1lyok"],"class":["oszt\u00e1ly"],"Deleting":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Save & Continue":["Ment\u00e9s \u00e9s folytat\u00e1s"],"To avoid losing your updates, save your changes before leaving.":["A friss\u00edt\u00e9sek elveszt\u00e9s\u00e9nek elker\u00fcl\u00e9se \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben mentse el a m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sokat, miel\u0151tt kil\u00e9p."],"You have unsaved changes in the Class Manager.":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak az Oszt\u00e1lykezel\u0151ben."],"You have unsaved changes":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak"],"Save changes":["V\u00e1ltoztat\u00e1sok ment\u00e9se"],"There are no global classes yet.":["M\u00e9g nincsenek glob\u00e1lis oszt\u00e1lyok."],"Will permanently remove it from your project and may affect the design across all elements using it. This action cannot be undone.":["V\u00e9glegesen elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a projektb\u0151l, \u00e9s hat\u00e1ssal lehet az \u00f6sszes haszn\u00e1l\u00f3 elem terv\u00e9re. Ez a m\u0171velet nem vonhat\u00f3 vissza."],"Delete this class?":["T\u00f6rli ezt a kurzust?"],"The Class Manager lets you see all the classes you've created, plus adjust their priority, rename them, and delete unused classes to keep your CSS structured.":["Az Oszt\u00e1lykezel\u0151 lehet\u0151v\u00e9 teszi az \u00f6sszes l\u00e9trehozott oszt\u00e1ly megtekint\u00e9s\u00e9t, valamint a priorit\u00e1suk m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t, \u00e1tnevez\u00e9s\u00fcket \u00e9s a nem haszn\u00e1lt oszt\u00e1lyok t\u00f6rl\u00e9s\u00e9t a CSS struktur\u00e1lts\u00e1g\u00e1nak meg\u0151rz\u00e9se \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben."],"Class Manager":["Oszt\u00e1lykezel\u0151"],"Sorry, nothing matched":["Sajn\u00e1lom, semmi sem tal\u00e1lt"],"Rename":["\u00c1tnevez\u00e9s"],"Clear all":["\u00d6sszes t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Got it":["Meg\u00e9rtettem"],"Footer":["L\u00e1bl\u00e9c"],"Header":["Fejl\u00e9c"],"Something went wrong":["Valami hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt"],"Done":["K\u00e9sz"],"Post":["K\u00f6zz\u00e9t\u00e9tel"],"Empty":["\u00dcres"],"More actions":["M\u00e9g t\u00f6bb m\u0171velet"],"Search":["Keres\u00e9s"],"Page":["Oldal"],"Cancel":["M\u00e9gse"],"Discard":["Eldob"],"Delete":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Before":["El\u0151tte"],"After":["Ut\u00e1na"]}},"comme